<title>CHINA: Ericsson in new China switching venture.</title>
<headline>Ericsson in new China switching venture.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Ericsson SPA has set up a new joint venture in China to produce programme-controlled switching systems, the Xinhua news agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The plant in Nanjing in the eastern province of Jiangsu would export most of its products and was expected to register sales of 1.5 billion yuan ($181 million) a year, Xinhua said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
